{"ideviceId":"idevice-1792785610708-ibfc15bpn","textInfoDurationInput":"","textInfoDurationTextInput":"Duração","textInfoParticipantsInput":"","textInfoParticipantsTextInput":"Agrupamento","textTextarea":"<p>Dividir é repartir uma quantidade em partes iguais. </p>
<p>Imagine que uma pessoa tem 12 maçãs e quer repartir igualmente entre 3 amigos. </p>
<p>Como podemos fazer isso?</p>
<p>Podemos entregar uma maçã para cada amigo, depois entregar mais uma para cada um e continuar até distribuir todas as maçãs.</p>
<p>No final, cada amigo receberá 4 maçãs.</p>
<p>Veja: </p>
<p>&lt;</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p><iframe width="100" height="760" style="width: 100%; height: 760px; border: 0; border-radius: 16px;" title="Animação interativa: divisão das 12 maçãs" loading="lazy" sandbox="allow-scripts" srcdoc="&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;html lang=&quot;pt-BR&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Divisão na prática: 12 maçãs&lt;/title&gt;&lt;style&gt;
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f0ff;font-family:Trebuchet MS,Arial,sans-serif;color:#14275c}.wrap{max-width:1050px;margin:18px auto;padding:14px;background:#fff8ed;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #34316a30}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.title{background:#123f88;color:white;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:20px;font-size:clamp(23px,3.8vw,37px);font-weight:900}.round{background:#e2dcff;border-radius:15px;padding:12px;font-weight:900}.scene{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(#ffe5c4 0 53%,#d69a62 53% 100%);border:5px solid #e4ad73;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px}.board{position:absolute;left:10%;top:7%;width:80%;height:48%;background:#65a38d;border:13px solid #b67a45;border-radius:13px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 12px #28594355}.question{position:absolute;top:4%;left:3%;background:white;border:3px solid #7676d3;border-radius:20px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:clamp(12px,1.7vw,18px);font-weight:800;max-width:29%;z-index:2}.people{position:absolute;top:23%;left:19%;width:75%;height:42%;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:end}.kid{width:26%;height:100%;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:end}.hair{width:76px;height:63px;border-radius:47% 47% 25% 25%;background:#60341d;position:absolute;top:1%;z-index:1}.face{width:68px;height:75px;border-radius:45%;background:#f5b780;z-index:2;position:absolute;top:10%;border:3px solid #9b5d35}.eyes{position:absolute;top:25px;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:16px}.smile{position:absolute;top:47px;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:19px}.body{height:54%;width:100px;border-radius:45px 45px 5px 5px;background:#347bd4;border:3px solid #25588e}.kid:nth-child(2) .hair{background:#382019;border-radius:50%;width:90px}.kid:nth-child(2) .face{background:#b8754b}.kid:nth-child(2) .body{background:#f9c43d;border-color:#cf8e16}.kid:nth-child(3) .hair{background:#202028}.kid:nth-child(3) .body{background:#3ab778;border-color:#228253}.glasses{position:absolute;top:22px;left:7px;font-size:32px;line-height:1}.baskets{position:absolute;top:55%;left:16%;width:79%;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;z-index:5}.basket{position:relative;width:23%;height:114px;border:7px solid #a45e23;border-radius:17px 17px 48px 48px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#e6a654 0 12px,#c47a32 13px 18px);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #f5c47d,0 5px 5px #663b1d44}.basket:before{content:&quot;&quot;;position:absolute;left:9%;width:82%;height:90px;bottom:22px;border:8px solid #ae6d2b;border-radius:60% 60% 0 0;z-index:-1}.basket .label{position:absolute;bottom:-20px;left:5%;width:90%;text-align:center;background:#fff8e9;border:2px solid #9a5d25;border-radius:9px;padding:4px;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap;font-size:clamp(11px,1.6vw,18px)}.apples{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:7}.apple{position:absolute;width:34px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:31px;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 1px #76350b55);transition:left .68s ease-in-out,top .68s ease-in-out;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.tray{position:absolute;top:78%;left:28%;width:44%;height:17%;background:#ad6d44;border:7px solid #7d4b2e;border-radius:22px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 5px #c99265}.remaining{position:absolute;bottom:3%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:white;border:3px solid #f6a327;border-radius:12px;padding:7px 15px;font-weight:900;z-index:8;white-space:nowrap}.footer{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px 0 5px}.footer button{border:0;border-radius:18px;padding:13px 20px;color:white;font-size:17px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 0 #0002}.start{background:#169d34}.step{background:#2168c9}.reset{background:#8741b4}.equation{display:none;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,42px);font-weight:900;background:#fff19a;border:3px solid #d59d1a;border-radius:16px;margin:12px auto;padding:12px;max-width:390px}.note{text-align:center;font-weight:700;padding:7px}.scene{aspect-ratio:1.75}@media(max-width:600px){.scene{aspect-ratio:1.12}.question{max-width:38%}.people{top:27%;left:8%;width:89%;height:34%}.hair{width:52px;height:45px}.face{width:50px;height:55px}.eyes{top:17px;font-size:12px}.smile{top:31px}.body{width:64px}.baskets{left:5%;width:91%;top:56%}.basket{height:88px;width:28%}.apple{font-size:24px;width:25px;height:25px}.tray{top:81%;left:18%;width:64%;height:13%}.remaining{font-size:12px}.footer button{font-size:14px;padding:12px}}
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;main class=&quot;wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;head&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;🍎 Divisão na prática!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;round&quot; id=&quot;round&quot;&gt;Rodada: 0 de 4&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;scene&quot; id=&quot;scene&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;board&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;question&quot;&gt;Vamos repartir 12 maçãs igualmente entre 3 amigos?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;people&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hair&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;face&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;eyes&quot;&gt;● &amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;smile&quot;&gt;◡&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hair&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;face&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;eyes&quot;&gt;● &amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;smile&quot;&gt;◡&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hair&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;face&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;eyes&quot;&gt;● &amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;glasses&quot;&gt;◎◎&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;smile&quot;&gt;◡&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;baskets&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;basket&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;label&quot; id=&quot;n0&quot;&gt;0 maçãs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;basket&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;label&quot; id=&quot;n1&quot;&gt;0 maçãs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;basket&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;label&quot; id=&quot;n2&quot;&gt;0 maçãs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tray&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;apples&quot; id=&quot;apples&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;remaining&quot; id=&quot;remaining&quot;&gt;Maçãs na mesa: 12&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;equation&quot; id=&quot;equation&quot;&gt;12 ÷ 3 = 4 ✓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot; id=&quot;note&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&gt;Observe as maçãs passando da mesa para as cestas.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;footer&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;start&quot; id=&quot;start&quot;&gt;▶ Iniciar distribuição&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;step&quot; id=&quot;step&quot;&gt;⏭ Entregar 1 maçã&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;reset&quot; id=&quot;reset&quot;&gt;↻ Recomeçar&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/main&gt;&lt;script&gt;
const scene=document.getElementById('scene'),layer=document.getElementById('apples');let apples=[],count=0,running=false,timer=null;function pos(x,y){return {left:x+'%',top:y+'%'}}function init(){clearTimeout(timer);running=false;count=0;layer.innerHTML='';apples=[];for(let i=0;i&lt;12;i++){let a=document.createElement('div');a.className='apple';a.textContent='🍎';let p=pos(33+(i%6)*6.7,83+Math.floor(i/6)*5);Object.assign(a.style,p);layer.appendChild(a);apples.push(a)}update()}function update(){document.getElementById('remaining').textContent='Maçãs na mesa: '+(12-count);document.getElementById('round').textContent='Rodada: '+Math.floor(count/3)+(count%3?' (em andamento)':'')+' de 4';for(let i=0;i&lt;3;i++){let n=Math.floor(count/3)+(count%3&gt;i?1:0);document.getElementById('n'+i).textContent=n+' '+(n===1?'maçã':'maçãs')}document.getElementById('equation').style.display=count===12?'block':'none';document.getElementById('note').textContent=count===12?'Distribuição concluída! Cada amigo recebeu 4 maçãs.':count===0?'Observe as maçãs passando da mesa para as cestas.':'Uma maçã de cada vez, sempre na mesma ordem.'}function step(){if(count&gt;=12)return;let i=count,b=i%3,round=Math.floor(i/3);let x=[27.5,55.5,83][b]+(round%2?5:-5),y=63+(round&gt;=2?7:0);Object.assign(apples[i].style,pos(x,y));count++;update()}function play(){if(running)return;running=true;function tick(){if(!running)return;if(count&lt;12){step();timer=setTimeout(tick,900)}else running=false}tick()}document.getElementById('start').onclick=play;document.getElementById('step').onclick=()=&gt;{running=false;clearTimeout(timer);step()};document.getElementById('reset').onclick=init;init();
&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;
"></iframe></p>
<p>Por isso podemos escrever:</p>
<p>12 :  3 = 4</p>
<p>Isso significa que 12 dividido por 3 é igual a 4.</p>
<p><strong>Hoje você descobriu que dividir é repartir uma quantidade em partes iguais. Nas próximas missões, vamos explorar outras situações e aprender novas maneiras de pensar sobre a divisão.</strong></p>
<h4><strong>Agora é sua vez!!!</strong></h4>","textFeedbackInput":"Mostrar Feedback","textFeedbackTextarea":""}
